.SH
Gadgets
.LP
Every gadget below is available to any crew with the caps to spare.
.SH
Aegis
.LP
The Aegis is a field device. Cost: 20 caps. Weight: 1 pounds.
It requires no training to operate and fits in a standard pack.
.SH
